            "review_text": "Fiona A\nMaynooth, Ireland2 contributions\n0\nRoll and Dinner\nJul 2013 • Couples\nWe went a few times for lunch we got a really good fresh take away roll. There is a great verity of fillings. We also went for dinner. There was a huge menu with great selection and wonderful food. The starter came before the main course which is always a plus in Vietnam. Overall great food and lovely place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 29, 2013",
